  "limits": "Reviewed static medium-fi exterior derived from the municipal measured section and actual2015/2016/2017 facade photographs. The original123692-triangle draft is preserved unchanged. The42.05m section-derived working height is retained; the historical48m description and AHN4 approximate surface/ground context remain conflicting/non-survey evidence. Repair maps the asymmetric foot, paired canal windows and stone crosses, filled upper brick niches and complete open lanterns. Window placements, repair brickwork, lead seams, scrolls and crown details are approximate original reconstructions. Static10:10 clocks; hidden timber frame, mechanisms, buried foundations, quay, moored boats and vegetation are excluded. Terrain-contact base needs local host pavement fitting; footprint replacement disabled."
